  "limitations": [
    "Independent three-commit research history,24ordinary files and425,999bytes:20text/script/log/JSONfiles, two existing source WebPs and two existing source crops. No new BLEND/GLB, render, applied candidate or model stage. It rejects only the fixed authored CLOUD_0 envelope filled at y3.72..3.80; it does not reject all possible side-cloud reconstruction.",
    "The supplied study records an in-memory290-vertex/576-triangleclosed thin body and intersections with the main roof, three ribs and side gable. New triangle-pair counts79/35/28/13/33 agree across producer and independent records; the old silhouette tube already had208/54/46/42/62pairs with those objects. Pair counts are discrete relationships, not penetration volume, depth or a safe/improved geometry ranking.",
    "Supplied independent double-precision winding records576actual face centroids and9inside samples, with positive distances0.003380411..0.053002980from the roof surface. Its inverse19vertex samples are all outside. Producer19inside plus2ambiguous samples come from a different866-point population and are not conflated with the independent9centroids. This archive checks frozen values and bindings without rerunning geometry, Blender or any supplied script.",
    "The study input R06b model models/roof-r06b-experiment.blend has recordedSHA2562e7ae9688d11a5dfa7f8c16f3003a14081af07256a8cb5ac20c5c6e87cfa4498. This independent evidence bundle intentionally contains no model. It references previously archived R06b history, not a fabricated Git ancestry; rerun scripts retain their original external sibling-directory assumption. R05, R06b and its metadata correction CURRENT/refs remain unchanged.",
    "Source10and11 support a continuous gold-surface category, not proof of the same side-cloud instance at two reliable angles. Left/right clipping, glare, backside, thickness, installation and native/time identity remain unresolved. Source10both groups being outside the fixed model camera frame is a model fact, not a source-identity finding. SOURCEFAILED/NOTAPPLIED remains.",
    "The seven-entry source-semantics index contains two source images present here and five references to prior R06b/forest evidence outside this24-filebundle. Those referenced model/render/viewport artifacts are not newly delivered or counted as new images. Earlier proposal wording remains as its historical stage; the later rejection and independent QA are the final decision.",
    "All original three commits, scripts, logs, failure evidence and stage trees are preserved byte-for-byte under new independent research archive/history refs. No production ref, CURRENT, old path or unrelated history is changed. No modeling/rendering, LFS, ZIP, force push, deletion of history, credentials copying, new permissions, main/security changes, Issues or PRs. Previously denied source-screening-increment receipt stays paused. Spaceversion0 remains retained pending parent consumption confirmation."
